msgstr "元组 (x, y, z)，均为有符号 16 位传感器原始计数。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:268
msgid ""
"Read IMU temperature. Firmware clamps temperatures below zero to 0 degrees Celsius; negative "
"temperatures cannot be recovered through this command."
msgstr "读取 IMU 温度。固件将零下温度截为 0 摄氏度，此命令无法还原负温度。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:270
msgid "Temperature in degrees Celsius, 0..655.35, resolution 0.01 degrees."
msgstr "温度，单位摄氏度，范围 0..655.35，分辨率 0.01 度。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:286
msgid "Set acceleration full-scale range. The setting is volatile."
msgstr "设置加速度满量程，设置不写入 Flash。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:288 ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:310
msgid ""
"An ACCEL_RANGE_* constant in ACCEL_RANGES, in g (2, 4, 8 or 16). Samples from read_accel() remain"
" in m/s^2."
msgstr "ACCEL_RANGES 中的 ACCEL_RANGE_* 常量，单位 g（2、4、8 或 16）；read_accel() 的采样单位仍为 m/s²。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:290 ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:330 ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:370
#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:410 ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:450 ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:492
