#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:649 ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:669 ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:715
msgid "No return value."
msgstr "无返回值。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:308
msgid "Get acceleration full-scale range."
msgstr "读取加速度满量程。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:326
msgid "Set the gyroscope full-scale range. The setting is volatile."
msgstr "设置陀螺仪满量程，设置不写入 Flash。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:328
msgid ""
"A GYRO_RANGE_* constant in GYRO_RANGES, in degrees/s (125, 250, 500, 1000 or 2000). Samples from "
"read_gyro() remain in rad/s."
msgstr "GYRO_RANGES 中的 GYRO_RANGE_* 常量，单位 °/s（125、250、500、1000 或 2000）；read_gyro() 的采样单位仍为 rad/s。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:348
msgid "Get the gyroscope full-scale range."
msgstr "读取陀螺仪满量程。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:350
msgid "Full-scale magnitude in degrees per second."
msgstr "满量程幅度，单位度每秒。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:366
msgid "Set acceleration sampling rate. The setting is volatile."
msgstr "设置加速度采样率，设置不写入 Flash。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:368 ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:390
msgid "An ODR_* constant in ACCEL_ODR_VALUES, in Hz; ODR_POWER_DOWN (0) disables this channel."
msgstr "ACCEL_ODR_VALUES 中的 ODR_* 常量，单位 Hz；ODR_POWER_DOWN（0）关闭该通道采样。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:388
msgid "Get acceleration sampling rate."
msgstr "读取加速度采样率。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:406
msgid "Set gyroscope sampling rate. The setting is volatile."
msgstr "设置陀螺仪采样率，设置不写入 Flash。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:408 ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:430
msgid "An ODR_* constant in GYRO_ODR_VALUES, in Hz; ODR_POWER_DOWN (0) disables this channel."
msgstr "GYRO_ODR_VALUES 中的 ODR_* 常量，单位 Hz；ODR_POWER_DOWN（0）关闭该通道采样。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:428
msgid "Get gyroscope sampling rate."
msgstr "读取陀螺仪采样率。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:446
msgid ""
"Select the enabled alarm sources. Zero disables all alarms. The setting is volatile. Bits: 1 "
"acceleration, 2 gyroscope, 4 temperature."
msgstr "选择启用的告警来源，0 禁用全部告警，设置不写入 Flash。各位：1 加速度、2 陀螺仪、4 温度。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:448 ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:470
msgid ""
"Alarm bitmask, 0..7; combine ALARM_* bits with ``|``, use ALARM_NONE to disable or ALARM_ALL to "
"enable all sources."
msgstr "告警掩码，范围 0..7；用 ``|`` 组合 ALARM_* 位，ALARM_NONE 关闭全部来源，ALARM_ALL 启用全部来源。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:468
msgid "Get the enabled alarm sources."
msgstr "读取启用的告警来源。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:486
msgid ""
"Set motion delta thresholds. Firmware compares each axis against its moving reference and "
"debounces transitions over five samples. The setting is volatile."
msgstr "设置运动变化阈值。固件将各轴与动态参考值比较，并对状态变化进行五次采样消抖；设置不写入 Flash。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:488
msgid "Acceleration delta in mg, 0..255."
msgstr "加速度变化量，单位 mg，范围 0..255。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:490
msgid "Angular velocity delta in degrees per second, 0..255."
msgstr "角速度变化量，单位度每秒，范围 0..255。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:510
msgid "Get motion delta thresholds."
msgstr "读取运动变化阈值。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:512
msgid "Tuple (accel_mg, gyro_dps), each 0..255."
msgstr "元组 (accel_mg, gyro_dps)，各项范围 0..255。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:528
msgid "Set the temperature alarm window. The setting is volatile."
msgstr "设置温度告警窗口，设置不写入 Flash。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:530 ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:532
msgid "Temperature in degrees Celsius. Range: 0..255; low must be less than high."
msgstr "温度，单位摄氏度。范围 0..255，low 必须小于 high。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:552
msgid "Get the temperature alarm window."
msgstr "读取温度告警窗口。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:554
msgid "Tuple (low, high). Temperature in degrees Celsius."
msgstr "元组 (low, high)。温度，单位摄氏度。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:570
msgid ""
"Register one event callback, replacing the previous callback. Registration does not change device"
" reporting settings. The callback receives one integer. Do not call Chain methods inside the "
"callback; record the event for the main loop. Bits 0 and 1 indicate acceleration and gyroscope "
"alarms. Bits 2..3: 0 normal or high-temperature alarm cleared, 1 high-temperature alarm, 2 low-"
"temperature alarm, 3 low-temperature alarm cleared. Preserve combinations; 0 is a valid recovery "
"event."
msgstr ""
"注册一个事件回调并替换此前的回调，不改变设备上报设置。回调接收一个整数参数。请在回调中记录事件，由主循环处理，不要在回调内调用 Chain 方法。位 0 和位 1 分别表示加速度与陀螺仪告警。位"
" 2..3：0 正常或高温告警解除，1 高温告警，2 低温告警，3 低温告警解除。应保留组合状态，0 也是有效的恢复事件。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:572
msgid "Function called with the event integer; None unregisters it."
msgstr "接收事件整数的函数；None 表示注销回调。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:591
msgid "Read the internal sensor I2C register space through Chain. This may clear sensor status registers."
msgstr "通过 Chain 读取内部传感器 I2C 寄存器；读取操作可能清除传感器状态位。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:593 ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:621
msgid "Seven-bit internal I2C address, 0x08..0x77."
msgstr "内部 I2C 七位地址，范围 0x08..0x77。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:595 ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:623
msgid "Register address, 0..255 for addrsize=8 or 0..65535 for addrsize=16."
msgstr "寄存器地址：addrsize=8 时为 0..255，addrsize=16 时为 0..65535。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:597
msgid "Number of bytes, 1..64."
msgstr "读取字节数，范围 1..64。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:599 ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:627
msgid "Register address width in bits, 8 or 16. Default: 8."
msgstr "寄存器地址位宽，8 或 16；默认为 8。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:601
msgid "Requested register bytes."
msgstr "请求的寄存器字节。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:619
msgid ""
"Write the internal sensor I2C register space through Chain. Direct register writes can change "
"measurement and alarm configuration; use sensor-specific configuration methods for normal "
"operation."
msgstr "通过 Chain 写入内部传感器 I2C 寄存器。直接写寄存器可能改变测量和告警配置；常规操作请使用传感器专用配置方法。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:625
msgid "Buffer containing 1..64 bytes."
msgstr "包含 1..64 字节的缓冲区。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:647
msgid ""
"Detach this object and its callbacks. Repeated calls are safe. Hardware configuration and the "
"shared ChainBus remain active."
msgstr "注销此对象及其回调，可重复调用。硬件配置和共享 ChainBus 保持运行。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:663
msgid ""
"Set the base RGB color. Firmware alarm or Pedal overlays can temporarily cover this color. This "
"setting is volatile."
msgstr "设置基础 RGB 颜色。固件告警或踏板叠加灯效可能暂时覆盖此颜色；此设置不写入 Flash。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:665 ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:691
msgid "RGB888 color, 0x000000..0xFFFFFF."
msgstr "RGB888 颜色，范围 0x000000..0xFFFFFF。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:667 ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:689
msgid "Base LED index; 0 for sensors, 0..3 for Pedal. Default: 0."
msgstr "基础灯索引：传感器为 0，Pedal 为 0..3；默认为 0。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:687
msgid "Get the configured base RGB color, excluding firmware overlays."
msgstr "读取配置的基础 RGB 颜色，不包含固件叠加灯效。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:709
msgid "Set the global RGB brightness. Saving writes device flash."
msgstr "设置全局 RGB 亮度，保存操作会写入设备 Flash。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:711 ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:735
msgid "Brightness in percent, 0..100."
msgstr "亮度百分比，范围 0..100。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:713
msgid "Save this setting to device flash. Default: False."
msgstr "是否将此设置保存到设备 Flash；默认为 False。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:733
msgid "Get the global RGB brightness."
msgstr "读取全局 RGB 亮度。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:751
msgid "Get the device UID."
msgstr "读取设备 UID。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:753
msgid "UID_4_BYTES (0) or UID_12_BYTES (1). Default: UID_4_BYTES (0)."
msgstr "UID_4_BYTES（0，4 字节）或 UID_12_BYTES（1，12 字节）。默认：UID_4_BYTES（0）。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:755
msgid "Four or twelve UID bytes."
msgstr "四个或十二个 UID 字节。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:773
msgid "Get the bootloader version."
msgstr "读取引导程序版本。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:775 ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:793 ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:811
msgid "Device-reported numeric identifier."
msgstr "设备返回的数值标识。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:791
msgid "Get the firmware version."
msgstr "读取固件版本。"

#: ../docs/source/chain/imu.rst:809
msgid "Get the device type."
msgstr "读取设备类型。"

#: ../../source/chain/imu.rst
msgid "IMU sensor display"
msgstr "IMU 数据显示"

#: ../../source/chain/imu.rst
msgid "Open the |m5core_chain_imu_basic_example.m5f2| project in UiFlow2."
msgstr "在 UiFlow2 中打开 |m5core_chain_imu_basic_example.m5f2| 项目。"

#: ../../source/chain/imu.rst
msgid ""
"Connect Chain IMU as the first device on M5Stack Basic UART2 (TX=21, RX=22). The screen has a "
"centered \"Chain IMU\" title, three X/Y/Z columns for acceleration (m/s2) and angular velocity "
"(rad/s), and a temperature reading (degrees Celsius) at the bottom. Readings refresh every 100 "
"ms. Acceleration and angular velocity are rounded to two decimal places, and temperature to one "
"decimal place."
msgstr ""
"将 Chain IMU 接为 M5Stack Basic UART2（TX=21、RX=22）上的第一个设备。屏幕顶部居中显示“Chain IMU”标题，中间按 X/Y/Z "
"三列显示加速度（m/s²）和角速度（rad/s），底部显示温度（°C）。数值每 100 ms 刷新，加速度和角速度四舍五入到两位小数，温度到一位小数。"

msgid "Bases: :py:class:`~chain.key.KeyChain`"
msgstr "基类：:py:class:`~chain.key.KeyChain`"

msgid "Driver for Chain IMU."
msgstr "Chain IMU 驱动。"

msgid "Detach the device and release all event callbacks; the shared bus stays open."
msgstr "注销设备并清除全部事件回调，保留共享总线。"

msgid "Register a specific IMU alarm or recovery callback."
msgstr "注册 IMU 报警或解除报警的回调函数。"

msgid ""
"Use EVENT_ACCEL_TRIGGER/CLEAR, EVENT_GYRO_TRIGGER/CLEAR, or "
"EVENT_TEMPERATURE_HIGH/LOW/HIGH_CLEAR/LOW_CLEAR. Each handler receives its selected event "
"constant. None removes only that event handler. Registration does not change alarm reporting. "
"Enable alarms afterwards. State tracking starts at zero when the first source is registered. "
"Recovery requires a prior alarm report, except explicit low recovery. Legacy source selectors and"
" the single-callback form receive raw status. set_event_callback(None) removes all handlers."
msgstr ""
"使用 EVENT_ACCEL_TRIGGER/CLEAR、EVENT_GYRO_TRIGGER/CLEAR 或 "
"EVENT_TEMPERATURE_HIGH/LOW/HIGH_CLEAR/LOW_CLEAR 选择事件。回调参数为所选事件常量。传入 None "
"可注销该事件的回调。注册回调不会改变报警设置，请在注册后开启报警。首次注册时，报警状态从零开始记录；除明确的低温解除事件外，解除报警需要先收到对应的报警。旧事件来源选择器和单回调形式接收原始状态值。set_event_callback(None)"
" 注销全部回调。"

msgid "An EVENT_* constant, legacy callback or None. Default: None."
msgstr "EVENT_* 事件常量、旧形式的回调函数或 None，默认 None。"

msgid "Handler receiving the selected event constant. Default: None."
msgstr "接收所选事件常量的回调函数，默认 None。"
